{"id":17875,"path":"/listening/b1/burgers-made-of-insects-listening-test/","parentId":1142,"order":970,"section":"listening","level":"b1","depth":3,"title":"Burgers made of insects – B1 English Listening Test","seo":{"title":"Burgers made of insects – B1 English Listening Test - Test-English","description":"Listening comprehension test for intermediate students (CEFR B1). Watch a video about food and choose the correct answers.","image":"/media/uploads/B1-Burgers-made-of-insects_Listening-test.jpg"},"modified":"2025-06-05T14:27:16","kind":"lesson","parts":["<h3>B1 English Listening Test</h3> <h5>Watch a video about food and diet, and for questions 1 to 7, choose the correct answer.</h5> <p></p> <div class=\"videoWrapper\"> <div data-youtube=\"5eibeYxRt5w\"></div> </div> <h6>For more videos like this, go to <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCknLrEdhRCp1aegoMqRaCZg\">DW News</a></h6> <div class=\"list-separator-dots\"><span>Questions</span></div> <div data-quiz=\"658\"></div>"],"explanation":null,"quizzes":[{"id":658,"questions":[{"id":5648,"num":"1","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>The girl who tries the burger ...</div>","choices":[{"id":9022,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>thinks it's OK.</span>"},{"id":9023,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>thinks it's fantastic. </span>"},{"id":9024,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>has some friends who would love it. </span>"}]},{"id":5649,"num":"2","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>The manufacturers of the insects ...</div>","choices":[{"id":9025,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>use insects that come from dead animals. </span>"},{"id":9026,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>have recently started breeding insects.</span>"},{"id":9027,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>produce insects that are used by different industries. </span>"}]},{"id":5650,"num":"3","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>Which sentence is true?</div>","choices":[{"id":9028,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>Insect food is not very popular among Europeans. </span>"},{"id":9029,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>Very few people around the world eat insects.</span>"},{"id":9030,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>Around 2 million people in Europe eat insects every day. </span>"}]},{"id":5652,"num":"4","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>The larvae ...</div>","choices":[{"id":9034,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>need a lot of water. </span>"},{"id":9035,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>contain 70% protein. </span>"},{"id":9036,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>are frozen before being sold.</span>"}]},{"id":5653,"num":"5","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>The founders of the company ...</div>","choices":[{"id":9037,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>employ a lot of people. </span>"},{"id":9038,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>learned about eating insects during a trip. </span>"},{"id":9039,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>earn 10,000 euros a month selling insects. </span>"}]},{"id":5654,"num":"6","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>Their friends and family ...</div>","choices":[{"id":9040,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>didn't think their business was a good idea. </span>"},{"id":9041,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>thought their idea was cool. </span>"},{"id":9042,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>wanted to try the burgers immediately. </span>"}]},{"id":5655,"num":"7","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>In Germany, </div>","choices":[{"id":9043,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>there are a few restaurants that sell these burgers. </span>"},{"id":9044,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>these hamburgers cost between 12 and 17 euros.</span>"},{"id":9045,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>it's still illegal to sell these burgers. </span>"}]}]}]}